<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werde</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wa</unclear> er dasselbig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewißlich</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">one</unclear> lanng
